Aim

To develop an online train reservation system for booking, cancelling, and managing train tickets.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for trains and check seat availability.
Enter passenger details and book tickets.
Make payment and generate the ticket with a PNR number.
Check PNR status and cancel tickets if required.
Admin manages train details, fares, users, and refunds.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online train reservation system was designed to manage train searches, ticket bookings, cancellations, PNR status, and refunds efficiently.
